{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1539233-weapon-tag-for-smoke-grenade-or-similar","id":1539233,"title":"Weapon Tag for Smoke Grenade or similar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-25T11:48:08-07:00","id":1539233,"title":"Weapon Tag for Smoke Grenade or similar","content":"Hi all, I ran into a slight conundrum which was smoke grenades and similar weapons that create field conditions that don't have damage as their primary purpose. Weapon tags are generally aimed for the injury condition, which makes sense, and non-lethal options are very similar, usually aiming for the Stunned condition or similar. I was thinking about taking a cue from the Non-Penetrating tag and put it at 0 cost and say it gives +1 enhancement for appropriate stunts, such as Blinded, that interfere with the target's perceptions. You could name it something like Disorienting. So, a smoke grenade would be Gas, Thrown, and Disorienting. Do people think this makes sense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25211-justinfernal","name":"justinfernal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25211_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-25T18:54:11-07:00","id":1539281,"title":"","content":"There is a blinding power tag in Aberrant. You could use that. It would make the weapon's only effect blinding instead of applying wounds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-25T19:31:03-07:00","id":1539287,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that would be an example of the appropriate stunts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25211-justinfernal","name":"justinfernal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25211_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}